  "description": "Lilian McKellion, the girl who wanted to avoid a bad end, willingly went to the insomniac emperor in place of her sister, Laelin. \n\nShe is tasked to help the sleepless emperor, who was cursed by a witch, by using her ability to induce sleep whenever she touches another person's body with her lips. \n\nCan Lilianne survive being with the emperor, ‘Kael Rue Kaldorf?' \n\n(Source: Kakao, translated)\n\n*Note: This is as promo one-shot for the web novel.*",
